Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||06-02-2001||06:04 PM||||Don't forget, a metal plate needs to be put above the engine to block interference from the ignition system, otherwise it could mess up the ECM. Though if you were to use shielded plug wires etc, it might be possible to avoid that!<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
